INFRASTRUCTURE CRYPTOGRAPHIC AUDIT REPORT - ADHI INDUSTRIAL SYSTEM
Target Environment: SCADA Telemetry Unit
Classification: MEDIUM RISK / SCHEDULED MIGRATION

Detected Configurations:
- Encryption Primitive: AES-128 block cipher utilized for operational data encryption.
- Vulnerability Assessment: Grover's search algorithm reduces bit-security to 64 bits.
- Recommended Action: Upgrade key length to AES-256 during upcoming maintenance cycle.